{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24627","headline":"病中数会张道士见讥以此荅之 · 白居易","name":"病中数会张道士见讥以此荅之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亦知数出妨将息，不可端居守寂寥。\n病即药窗眠尽日，兴来酒席坐通宵。\n贤人易狎须勤饮，姹女难禁莫慢烧。\n张道士输白道士，一杯沆[瀣]便逍遥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}